msgid "In Amazon SNS, subscribe the URL (protocol HTTPS) to the topic that receives the Delivery, Bounce and Complaint notifications of Amazon SES. Mailspur confirms the subscription automatically."
msgstr "In Amazon SNS, iscrivi l'URL (protocollo HTTPS) al topic che riceve le notifiche Delivery, Bounce e Complaint di Amazon SES. Mailspur conferma l'iscrizione automaticamente."

msgid "In Brevo, open Transactional → Settings → Webhook, add the URL and select Delivered, Hard bounce, Soft bounce, Invalid email and Complaint."
msgstr "In Brevo, apri Transactional → Settings → Webhook, aggiungi l'URL e seleziona Delivered, Hard bounce, Soft bounce, Invalid email e Complaint."

msgid "In Mailgun, open Sending → Webhooks, add the URL for Delivered, Permanent failure, Temporary failure and Spam complaints, and paste the HTTP webhook signing key below."
msgstr "In Mailgun, apri Sending → Webhooks, aggiungi l'URL per Delivered, Permanent failure, Temporary failure e Spam complaints, e incolla qui sotto la HTTP webhook signing key."

msgid "In Postmark, open your server → Webhooks → Add webhook, paste the URL and select Delivery, Bounce and Spam complaint."
msgstr "In Postmark, apri il tuo server → Webhooks → Add webhook, incolla l'URL e seleziona Delivery, Bounce e Spam complaint."

msgid "In the Microsoft 365 admin center, open the user → Mail → Manage email apps and enable \"Authenticated SMTP\"."
msgstr "Nell'interfaccia di amministrazione di Microsoft 365, apri l'utente → Posta → Gestisci app di posta elettronica e abilita \"SMTP autenticato\"."

msgid "Inboxes show roughly the first 40–80 characters; the rest is cut off, on phones even earlier."
msgstr "Le caselle di posta mostrano all'incirca i primi 40–80 caratteri; il resto viene tagliato, sugli smartphone anche prima."

